## Completion provenance and scope

The [complete current state](ingestion_state.json) and [current per-course pass](../../../runtime/ingest/logs/20261018T195113+0200_weeks1-3_five_courses.md) certify the selected final notes and cited figures at revision3. The global multi-course pass may remain incomplete while this course is independently complete. Earlier completed passes linked in metadata retain their bounded provenance; newly copied notes do not retroactively certify unrelated sections. All selected headings occur in state.finished_notes.headings; exact state hashes were checked before drafting. Plan reads finished notes, committed records and referenced assets only, not original course materials.

## Snapshot and semantic changes

Entries give actual path/bytes/SHA256, exact selected headings, semantic baseline/objective map and available previous hash. Unchanged academic passages keep old criteria; new note material receives new objectives and the additive hub remains context. Source ambiguity, administrative contradictions, notation/numbering discrepancies and unprepared advertised methods remain qualified. No access errors/deletion or unresolved semantic change is concealed.

